# doppler_integration_azure_dynamic_service_principal_oidc (Resource)

Manage an Azure Dynamic Service Principal Doppler integration using workload identity federation.

The managing app registration must already exist in your tenant, with a service principal, admin-consented Microsoft Graph application permissions, and ownership of the target applications it manages.

